# Avatar models are large binaries. avatar.glb is committed deliberately so the
# repo works on clone with no extra setup - it is 48 MiB, under GitHub's 50 MiB
# warning threshold. Any OTHER model dropped in here stays out of git; if one
# ever exceeds ~50 MiB, use Git LFS rather than committing it directly.
public/models/*.glb
public/models/*.gltf
public/models/*.bin
!public/models/avatar.glb
